// https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#pageswapeventinit

// The `ViewTransition? viewTransition` member was here. It handed script the
// DOMViewTransition object -- the `.ready` / `.finished` / `.updateCallbackDone`
// promise wrapper around a running view transition -- and DOMViewTransition was
// deleted with the rest of the script-facing bindings. The transition itself
// (core/view_transition/view_transition.h) is untouched; what is gone is the
// handle script used to observe it, and view_transition.idl with it.
dictionary PageSwapEventInit : EventInit {
};
